+## Scope among installed research skills
+
+Use one workflow for the requested outcome. General literature discovery belongs
+to `nature-academic-search`; manuscript drafting, polishing, mock review and
+reviewer replies have focused `nature-*` entries. PDF bilingual translation uses
+`personal-translate-paper-zh`. Use the corresponding ARS writing/review workflow
+when the user explicitly requests ARS or an existing ARS project needs it; do not
+run both suites for the same deliverable. PaperSpine remains an explicit
+end-to-end alternative, not another automatic stage.
 
